OL,3,AGreen Party wants to make sure it is
OL,4,A'not vulnerable to extremists'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Green Party has said it wants to
OL,7,Fmake sure it is not "vulnerable to
OL,8,Fcapture by extremists and racists"
OL,9,Fafter members voted for a motion that
OL,10,Fclaimed Zionism was racism.
OL,12,FThe motion put forward by activists,
OL,13,Fwhich became formal policy after it was
OL,14,Fapproved at the Green's conference
OL,15,Fearlier this month, has divided party
OL,16,Ffigures and been criticised by Jewish
OL,17,Fgroups.
OL,19,FWestminster leader Ellie Chowns told
OL,20,Fthe BBC it was a "significant and
OL,21,Fdamaging policy" and she would work to
OL,22,Freform the party.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
