OL,3,AGreen Party wants to make sure it is
OL,4,A'not vulnerable to extremists'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after former leader Caroline
OL,7,FLucas said she felt the Green's
OL,8,Fstructures were not protecting if from
OL,9,F"entryism" - where people sign up to a
OL,10,Fparty to try to change it.
